---
/** Freemium call to action shown after the tool. No pricing. */
---
<aside class="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-h">
  <p class="kicker">Beyond public data</p>
  <h2 id="cta-h">Want this on your customer or CRM data, calibrated and validated?</h2>
  <p>The free workbench runs on public Census microdata and labels every assumption. The same approach can run on your own records, with the population calibrated to your customers and the scenario logic validated against outcomes you have actually observed.</p>
  <a class="cta-link" href="/contact/?topic=population-simulation">Start a conversation</a>
</aside>
<style>
.cta{margin:48px 0 10px;padding:28px 30px;border:1px solid var(--rule);background:var(--card)}
.cta h2{margin:6px 0 12px;font-size:28px;max-width:760px}
.cta p{margin-bottom:16px}
.cta-link{display:inline-block;background:var(--verm);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:2px}
.cta-link:hover{background:#b02d1f}
@media(max-width:620px){.cta{padding:22px 18px}.cta h2{font-size:23px}}
</style>
